        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "sdc01_0190_sister_03",
      "hash64": "41F0C06CE512CB54",
      "text": "Ese crío que acabamos de ver... y que se ha ido\\nal monte...[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 59,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "sdc01_0190_sister_04",
      "hash64": "41F0BF6CE512C9A1",
      "text": "¡¿Era el ogro?! ¡¿El de la historia de los carteles?![VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 53,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "sdc01_0190_sister_05",
      "hash64": "41F0BE6CE512C7EE",
      "text": "¡¿Me estás diciendo que es real y que todo eso\\nocurrió de verdad?![VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 66,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "sdc01_0190_sister_06",
      "hash64": "41F0BD6CE512C63B",
      "text": "Aunque viendo la máscara que se le ha caído...\\nSupongo que está bastante claro.[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
